Kororo...

1760
01:29:01,018 --> 01:29:01,998
ころないで…
Don't kill me...

1761
01:29:02,418 --> 01:29:04,938
こっちころられたらさ、どこも行けない。
If we get killed over here, we can't go anywhere.

1762
01:29:09,789 --> 01:29:11,289
