Well, since they'll deliver it. Let's see... what their movements are.

1764
01:29:32,138 --> 01:29:32,878
のーてぃあー
Notia~

1765
01:29:43,278 --> 01:29:45,878
つづっ…つづっ…つづっちゃんもいるし、めらっちゃんもいるし…
Tsuzu... Tsuzu... Tsuzuruchan is here, and Melachan is too...

1766
01:29:51,589 --> 01:29:53,989
あの大きな声出して大丈夫なのもずり。
Raising your loud voice is fine too, Zuri.

1767
