Eh, why, where is it creepy, noja? Creepy places...

1794
01:31:10,735 --> 01:31:13,375
なんかエイリアンのパンキみたいなの顔についてるけど。
You've got something like an alien pancake on your face though.

1795
01:31:14,835 --> 01:31:16,595
なにしたの、めらち？
What did you do, Mela-chi?

1796
01:31:16,695 --> 01:31:19,095
あのね、キモい魚に食われた。
Well, I got eaten by a creepy fish.

1797
01:31:19,855 --> 01:31:21,315
あ、そういうことなんだ！
Oh, so that's what happened!

1798
01:31:21,655 --> 01:31:24,795
一旦納品してきてほしいのじゃ。
Please deliver it to the drop-off point first, noja.

1799
01:31:25,295 --> 01:31:25,955
はーい。
Okay.

1800
